<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessel loadings and movements.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessel loadings and movements.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows -</p>
<p>(in tonnes)</p>
<p> Vessel	  Date of Arrival   Quantity   Destination</p>
<p> RAB	     28/10/96	    7,000	 Nigeria</p>
<p> Lugoj	   29/10/96	    8,000	 Syria</p>
<p> Bang Luang    01/11/96	     N/A	  Malaysia</p>
<p> Syrus	   01/11/96	    1,200	 Guam</p>
<p> Asia Progress 01/11/96	   11,000	 Nigeria</p>
<p> Iran Mosid    01/11/96	    5,000	 Iran</p>
<p> An Si Jiang   01/11/96	    4,500	 China</p>
<p> Bang Bunnak   04/11/96	    5,400	 Brunei</p>
<p> Ashakruea     04/11/96	    6,600	 Malaysia</p>
<p> Dinitrakif    06/11/96	    5,000	 Africa</p>
<p> Ekaraj Dagros 06/11/96	    6,000	 Malaysia</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
